* 5V to 9V Boost Converter
Vin in 0 5
L1 in sw 22u
M1 sw gate 0 0 NMOS W=1 L=1
D1 sw out DIODE
C1 out 0 100u
Rload out 0 0.8
Vgate gate 0 PULSE(0 12 0 1n 1n 5.8u 10u)
.model NMOS NMOS(Vto=1 Kp=2 Lambda=0)
.model DIODE D
.tran 1u 10m
.end
